{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"لِلْمُطَفِّفِينَ","d":"lil'muṭaffifīna","e":"to those who give less"}],"a":{"g":"Woe to those who give less [than due],"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"اكْتَالُوا","d":"ik'tālū","e":"they take a measure"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"from"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"the people"},{"c":"يَسْتَوْفُونَ","d":"yastawfūna","e":"they take in full"}],"a":{"g":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"But when"},{"c":"كَالُوهُمْ","d":"kālūhum","e":"they give by measure (to) them"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"وَزَنُوهُمْ","d":"wazanūhum","e":"they weigh (for) them"},{"c":"يُخْسِرُونَ","d":"yukh'sirūna","e":"they give less"}],"a":{"g":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَا","d":"alā","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَظُنُّ","d":"yaẓunnu","e":"think"},{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"those"},{"c":"أَنَّهُمْ","d":"annahum","e":"that they"},{"c":"مَبْعُوثُونَ","d":"mabʿūthūna","e":"(will be) resurrected"}],"a":{"g":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَوْمٍ","d":"liyawmin","e":"For a Day"},{"c":"عَظِيمٍ","d":"ʿaẓīmin","e":"Great"}],"a":{"g":"For a tremendous Day -"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَقُومُ","d":"yaqūmu","e":"will stand"},{"c":"النَّاسُ","d":"l-nāsu","e":"mankind"},{"c":"لِرَبِّ","d":"lirabbi","e":"before (the) Lord"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"(of) the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds?"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"كِتَابَ","d":"kitāba","e":"(the) record"},{"c":"الْفُجَّارِ","d":"l-fujāri","e":"(of) the wicked"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(is) surely in"},{"c":"سِجِّينٍ","d":"sijjīnin","e":"Sijjin"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"سِجِّينٌ","d":"sijjīnun","e":"(is) Sijjin"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen?"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"A book"},{"c":"مَرْقُومٌ","d":"marqūmun","e":"written"}],"a":{"g":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers,"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"yukadhibūna","e":"deny"},{"c":"بِيَوْمِ","d":"biyawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"Who deny the Day of Recompense."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يُكَذِّبُ","d":"yukadhibu","e":"can deny"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"[of] it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"every"},{"c":"مُعْتَدٍ","d":"muʿ'tadin","e":"transgressor"},{"c":"أَثِيمٍ","d":"athīmin","e":"sinful"}],"a":{"g":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"تُتْلَى","d":"tut'lā","e":"are recited"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"ءَايَاتُنَا","d":"āyātunā","e":"Our Verses"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"he says"},{"c":"أَسَاطِيرُ","d":"asāṭīru","e":"Stories"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"(of) the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\""}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"But"},{"c":"رَانَ","d":"rāna","e":"(the) stain has covered"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[over]"},{"c":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","d":"qulūbihim","e":"their hearts"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(for) what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"يَكْسِبُونَ","d":"yaksibūna","e":"earning"}],"a":{"g":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لَمَحْجُوبُونَ","d":"lamaḥjūbūna","e":"surely will be partitioned"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"indeed they"},{"c":"لَصَالُوا","d":"laṣālū","e":"(surely) will burn"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمِ","d":"l-jaḥīmi","e":"(in) the Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"يُقَالُ","d":"yuqālu","e":"it will be said"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"[of it]"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"tukadhibūna","e":"deny"}],"a":{"g":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny.\""}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"كِتَابَ","d":"kitāba","e":"(the) record"},{"c":"الْأَبْرَارِ","d":"l-abrāri","e":"(of) the righteous"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(will be) surely in"},{"c":"عِلِّيِّينَ","d":"ʿilliyyīna","e":"Illiyin"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in 'illiyyun."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"عِلِّيُّونَ","d":"ʿilliyyūna","e":"(is) Illiyun"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is 'illiyyun?"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"A book"},{"c":"مَرْقُومٌ","d":"marqūmun","e":"written"}],"a":{"g":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"يَشْهَدُهُ","d":"yashhaduhu","e":"Witness it"},{"c":"الْمُقَرَّبُونَ","d":"l-muqarabūna","e":"those brought near"}],"a":{"g":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allah]."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْأَبْرَارَ","d":"l-abrāra","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(will be) surely in"},{"c":"نَعِيمٍ","d":"naʿīmin","e":"bliss"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"On"},{"c":"الْأَرَائِكِ","d":"l-arāiki","e":"thrones"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُونَ","d":"yanẓurūna","e":"observing"}],"a":{"g":"On adorned couches, observing."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"تَعْرِفُ","d":"taʿrifu","e":"You will recognize"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"وُجُوهِهِمْ","d":"wujūhihim","e":"their faces"},{"c":"نَضْرَةَ","d":"naḍrata","e":"(the) radiance"},{"c":"النَّعِيمِ","d":"l-naʿīmi","e":"(of) bliss"}],"a":{"g":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"يُسْقَوْنَ","d":"yus'qawna","e":"They will be given to drink"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رَحِيقٍ","d":"raḥīqin","e":"a pure wine"},{"c":"مَخْتُومٍ","d":"makhtūmin","e":"sealed"}],"a":{"g":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"خِتَامُهُ","d":"khitāmuhu","e":"Its seal"},{"c":"مِسْكٌ","d":"mis'kun","e":"(will be of) musk"},{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"And for"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"فَلْيَتَنَافَسِ","d":"falyatanāfasi","e":"let aspire"},{"c":"الْمُتَنَافِسُونَ","d":"l-mutanāfisūna","e":"the aspirers"}],"a":{"g":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِزَاجُهُ","d":"wamizājuhu","e":"And its mixture"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(is) of"},{"c":"تَسْنِيمٍ","d":"tasnīmin","e":"Tasnim"}],"a":{"g":"And its mixture is of Tasneem,"}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"عَيْنًا","d":"ʿaynan","e":"A spring"},{"c":"يَشْرَبُ","d":"yashrabu","e":"will drink"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"from it"},{"c":"الْمُقَرَّبُونَ","d":"l-muqarabūna","e":"those brought near"}],"a":{"g":"A spring from which those near [to Allah] drink."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"أَجْرَمُوا","d":"ajramū","e":"committed crimes"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"used (to)"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"at"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"يَضْحَكُونَ","d":"yaḍḥakūna","e":"laugh"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"مَرُّوا","d":"marrū","e":"they passed"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"by them"},{"c":"يَتَغَامَزُونَ","d":"yataghāmazūna","e":"they winked at one another"}],"a":{"g":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"انْقَلَبُوا","d":"inqalabū","e":"they returned"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"أَهْلِهِمُ","d":"ahlihimu","e":"their people"},{"c":"انْقَلَبُوا","d":"inqalabū","e":"they would return"},{"c":"فَكِهِينَ","d":"fakihīna","e":"jesting"}],"a":{"g":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"رَأَوْهُمْ","d":"ra-awhum","e":"they saw them"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"they said"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"لَضَالُّونَ","d":"laḍāllūna","e":"surely have gone astray"}],"a":{"g":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost.\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"But not"},{"c":"أُرْسِلُوا","d":"ur'silū","e":"they had been sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"over them"},{"c":"حَافِظِينَ","d":"ḥāfiẓīna","e":"(as) guardians"}],"a":{"g":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْيَوْمَ","d":"fal-yawma","e":"So today"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"at"},{"c":"الْكُفَّارِ","d":"l-kufāri","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"يَضْحَكُونَ","d":"yaḍḥakūna","e":"they will laugh"}],"a":{"g":"So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers,"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"On"},{"c":"الْأَرَائِكِ","d":"l-arāiki","e":"the thrones"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُونَ","d":"yanẓurūna","e":"observing"}],"a":{"g":"On adorned couches, observing."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Have (not)"},{"c":"ثُوِّبَ","d":"thuwwiba","e":"been paid"},{"c":"الْكُفَّارُ","d":"l-kufāru","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(for) what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَفْعَلُونَ","d":"yafʿalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do?"}}}